ers/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-03T16:15:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-03T16:15:16Z","body":"> Both are probably related to the changes on rendering released in 4.4-dev4, but (from what I read) [#99420](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99420) seems to be only 2d, and for each frame, while here it seems only 3d, and only once, usually first display of a material/shader.\n\nThat's right. I don't think #99420 is related. This is most likely a regression from the Ubershader PR (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90400)\n\nCC @DarioSamo ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2515000114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637245138","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99964#issuecomment-2637245138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99964","id":2637245138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dMSrS","user":{"login":"eldidou","id":7119609,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTk2MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7119609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou","html_url":"https://github.com/eldidou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eldidou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T15:28:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:28:06Z","body":"I've bisected the issue to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/427ba09efc70b2ad836bfa2441a242bbda10ba36, in particular in _servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl_, the mask size changes (from `15U` to `63U`) seems to trigger the issue.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637245138/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637445703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99964#issuecomment-2637445703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99964","id":2637445703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dNDpH","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T16:37:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T16:37:43Z","body":"> I've bisected the issue to [427ba09](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/427ba09efc70b2ad836bfa2441a242bbda10ba36), in particular in _servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl_, the mask size changes (from `15U` to `63U`) seems to trigger the issue.\n\nI think this might be something along the lines of the shader compiler unrolling as many times as it could possibly have it instead of making a dynamic loop like it should, because increasing the mask size itself shouldn't be _that_ big of an issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637445703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637653873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99964#issuecomment-2637653873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99964","id":2637653873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dN2dx","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"M